00:09:53.259 --> 00:09:56.470
You take the elevator up and
we're coming off the elevator,

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:58.139
walking around the corner.
You're just like, it's quiet.

00:09:58.139 --> 00:09:58.973
Like why is that?

00:09:58.973 --> 00:10:00.266
- Oh, I thought we was
like the first people there

00:10:00.266 --> 00:10:01.100
and we were late.

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.644
So I was like, don't you tell
me that these white people.

00:10:06.105 --> 00:10:10.026
I'm like "We them Negroes that's early?"

00:10:10.026 --> 00:10:12.028
I said, we going to get all this open bar.

00:10:12.028 --> 00:10:14.739
So when I walked around
the corner and saw-

00:10:16.032 --> 00:10:17.617
- [Crowd] Surprise!

00:10:21.078 --> 00:10:21.912
- Whoo!

00:10:23.414 --> 00:10:26.167
(Bresha squeals)

00:10:33.341 --> 00:10:35.926
(Bresha cries)

00:10:38.137 --> 00:10:38.971
- Really?

00:10:41.432 --> 00:10:45.978
Oh my.

00:10:45.978 --> 00:10:46.812
Oh my God.

00:10:49.815 --> 00:10:51.942
He told me it was a dinner.

00:10:51.942 --> 00:10:54.904
(crowd laughs)

00:10:54.904 --> 00:10:56.989
- [Person] Girl, he lied.

00:10:59.325 --> 00:11:00.159
- Oh my God.

00:11:06.415 --> 00:11:11.379
Are you serious?
- (crowd laughs)

00:11:13.172 --> 00:11:15.758
(crowd cheers)

00:11:18.928 --> 00:11:20.680
- And I'm like, what?

00:11:22.139 --> 00:11:23.182
It's happening!

00:11:24.016 --> 00:11:27.603
I really thought I died.
I really thought I died.

00:11:27.603 --> 00:11:31.107
I thought we all died and
showed up at heaven together.

00:11:31.107 --> 00:11:31.941
- (Nick laughs)
- Yeah.

00:11:31.941 --> 00:11:32.900
I could not believe it.

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:34.985
It was the best day of my life.

00:11:34.985 --> 00:11:35.903
- Mine's too.

00:11:35.903 --> 00:11:37.446
- And then when you showed me the ring, I,

00:11:37.446 --> 00:11:38.823
I really thought you had died.

00:11:38.823 --> 00:11:42.326
I really thought that you,
I thought we were dead.

00:11:42.326 --> 00:11:45.079
I was like, he did not get my dream ring.

00:11:45.079 --> 00:11:47.790
Like he's not even supposed to know this.

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:49.458
Who told him about my dream ring?

00:11:49.458 --> 00:11:52.670
Like he said that he was a
Zales, Jared type of nigga.

00:11:55.047 --> 00:11:56.382
Why does he have my dream ring? My God.

00:11:56.382 --> 00:11:57.216
- Oh. - God is good, won't
he do it?! Hallelujah!

00:11:57.216 --> 00:11:59.635
(calm music)

00:12:07.727 --> 00:12:09.186
- My favorite moment in the movie

00:12:09.186 --> 00:12:11.897
is when you know the mother,

00:12:11.897 --> 00:12:13.774
she's trying to take the kid.

00:12:13.774 --> 00:12:16.277
She's like, Hey, no Alfre Woodard.

00:12:16.277 --> 00:12:18.446
She's just like, we're taking the kid.

00:12:18.446 --> 00:12:19.822
You know, the kids come, you
know, Maddy's coming with us.

00:12:19.822 --> 00:12:23.743
Right. Like, you know, and
he's just like, all right,

00:12:23.743 --> 00:12:24.577
I hear you. You know?

00:12:24.577 --> 00:12:27.079
And I, and "I'mma think about it."

00:12:28.539 --> 00:12:29.373
- Okay.

00:12:35.629 --> 00:12:36.672
- I thought about it.

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:39.884
Yeah. I just, I just thought about it.

00:12:39.884 --> 00:12:41.552
You're right.

00:12:41.552 --> 00:12:42.386
No Marion. You're right.

00:12:42.386 --> 00:12:45.222
I can't, I can't do it, but you know what?

00:12:45.222 --> 00:12:48.184
I'm going to do it.

00:12:48.184 --> 00:12:49.101
Yeah. I'm going to do it.

00:12:49.101 --> 00:12:51.145
I'm going to bring Maddy up.

00:12:51.145 --> 00:12:54.982
I'm, I'm a bring Maddy
up because I'm a father.

00:12:54.982 --> 00:12:56.984
- And for me, I was just like, that's my.

00:12:58.652 --> 00:13:00.863
Yeah. And so for me, like, you know,

00:13:00.863 --> 00:13:03.491
Kevin kind of like in the film,

00:13:03.491 --> 00:13:05.326
taking that responsibility
and being like, you know what,

00:13:05.326 --> 00:13:09.371
like I'm gonna do it is the
story of so many single Black

00:13:09.371 --> 00:13:12.124
women, you know, in, in the world,

00:13:12.124 --> 00:13:14.335
that just have to like, do it.

00:13:14.335 --> 00:13:15.294
- Mean including you, Nick.

00:13:15.294 --> 00:13:18.672
I mean, come on Nick.

00:13:18.672 --> 00:13:22.551
Let's not forget. You are a single dad.

00:13:22.551 --> 00:13:23.385
You share it.

00:13:23.385 --> 00:13:26.680
- Not anymore.
- Not anymore. Aw I love you.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:28.974
But like, but you were, when I met,

00:13:28.974 --> 00:13:31.977
you were a single dad and
you were doing it well,

00:13:31.977 --> 00:13:32.812
and you had to,

00:13:32.812 --> 00:13:34.897
you were telling me how you
had to go to those parent

00:13:34.897 --> 00:13:35.689
classes.
- Yeah.

00:13:35.689 --> 00:13:37.274
- That was one funny thing about like,

00:13:37.274 --> 00:13:40.528
stop the crying. How do I stop crying?

00:13:40.528 --> 00:13:42.154
- She just went to sleep.

00:13:42.154 --> 00:13:44.532
But she's been like
crying for hours. I mean,

00:13:44.532 --> 00:13:46.283
hours to the point where I'm,

00:13:46.283 --> 00:13:49.620
I'm exhausted and my face hurts
and I'm getting frustrated.

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:52.832
- Okay, well, sorry, but this
is a group for new mothers.

00:13:52.832 --> 00:13:56.335
- You lying. Because on that
sign out there says parents.

00:13:56.335 --> 00:13:58.087
- I can imagine you in those situations,

00:13:58.087 --> 00:14:00.089
you wouldn't even know
how to change a diaper

00:14:00.089 --> 00:14:03.008
when McKenzie was born, and
McKenzie makes it so hard with

00:14:03.008 --> 00:14:06.720
those big, beautiful brown
eyes, she looks at you like,

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:08.222
why are you doing this to me?

00:14:08.222 --> 00:14:09.056
And that little girl in the movie? Oh.

00:14:09.056 --> 00:14:11.350
- Yeah, she was perfect.

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:14.395
- That little chocolate princess.

00:14:14.395 --> 00:14:17.523
She was, I fell in love
with her. I, I did.

00:14:17.523 --> 00:14:20.609
I mean, the movie was great,
but she's a superstar.

00:14:20.609 --> 00:14:22.278
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:14:22.278 --> 00:14:23.237
Melody Hurd.
- Yeah.

00:14:23.237 --> 00:14:26.574
- Oh, so adorable.

00:14:26.574 --> 00:14:27.408
- Well, she was great.

00:14:27.408 --> 00:14:31.787
- She was great. She was a
star, just so, I'm so proud.

00:14:31.787 --> 00:14:33.998
I left the movie just very proud of it.

00:14:35.082 --> 00:14:35.916
And I,

00:14:35.916 --> 00:14:39.003
I love that they showed that
you could find love again,

00:14:39.003 --> 00:14:41.046
you know? And for you, like.

00:14:41.046 --> 00:14:42.381
I mean...
- For me, it was,

00:14:42.381 --> 00:14:45.342
it was scary for me
because I remember when,

00:14:45.342 --> 00:14:47.845
when Kenzie was first born
and I'm sitting here thinking

00:14:47.845 --> 00:14:50.264
like, yo, nobody's going
to want to date me.

00:14:50.264 --> 00:14:51.098
Like I got baggage. And
so I was like, all right.

00:14:51.098 --> 00:14:54.602
And I just kind of like went
through life or for a good

00:14:54.602 --> 00:14:56.687
maybe year, half year, you know,

00:14:56.687 --> 00:14:59.523
thinking I'm just gonna
be single for a while,

00:14:59.523 --> 00:15:01.066
at least until she's like, of a,

00:15:01.066 --> 00:15:02.818
of a good like dating age, you know,

00:15:02.818 --> 00:15:04.987
because I feel like nobody's
going to want to come into a

00:15:04.987 --> 00:15:07.615
situation where it's just
like, oh, he's got an infant,

00:15:07.615 --> 00:15:08.449
you know? Oh,

00:15:08.449 --> 00:15:10.451
he might be getting back with
the mother or whatever that.

00:15:10.451 --> 00:15:12.912
- First of all, no disrespect mother,

00:15:12.912 --> 00:15:14.747
like you trying to take my accent.

00:15:14.747 --> 00:15:19.126
- I think I say, mother,
I say mother, muva now,

00:15:19.126 --> 00:15:22.630
since we've been together,
because that's how you say it.

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:25.758
It's like, it's like, what is
that like a Baltimore thing?

00:15:25.758 --> 00:15:29.345
Like y'all, don't pronounce
the T or the T's a V?

00:15:29.345 --> 00:15:31.931
- It's Baltimore. It's muva.

00:15:31.931 --> 00:15:32.681
- 'Muva'?

00:15:32.681 --> 00:15:33.515
- 'Fava'.

00:15:33.515 --> 00:15:34.725
- Say 'Two'.

00:15:34.725 --> 00:15:37.394
(woman struggles to pronounce "Two")

00:15:37.394 --> 00:15:41.148
- Two.
- No no say it.

00:15:41.148 --> 00:15:42.566
- Two.

00:15:42.566 --> 00:15:44.193
- (laughing) I love it.

00:15:45.569 --> 00:15:47.988
(calm music)

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:52.326
- We're doing things the
way I've always dreamt

00:15:52.326 --> 00:15:55.829
of how I've always wanted my life

00:15:55.829 --> 00:15:57.122
to be, you know,

00:15:57.122 --> 00:16:00.918
and how I think you've always
wanted your life to be,

00:16:00.918 --> 00:16:03.045
which is awesome, you know,

00:16:03.045 --> 00:16:05.798
to plan

00:16:07.466 --> 00:16:08.425
and to comfortably

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:11.845
do things the way that we dream of

00:16:11.845 --> 00:16:13.889
and the way we want it.

00:16:15.015 --> 00:16:16.934
- I love that for us.

00:16:16.934 --> 00:16:18.185
- I love that for us too.

00:16:19.103 --> 00:16:20.896
That's Black excellence.
- Opulence

00:16:21.981 --> 00:16:23.232
- Decadence.
- Tuxes next

00:16:23.232 --> 00:16:26.110
to the president.
(both scream)

00:16:29.655 --> 00:16:33.283
- That's our thing. I love it. You know,

00:16:33.283 --> 00:16:36.996
cause it's just, it's
just so beautiful to just,

00:16:36.996 --> 00:16:40.207
just walk through in our art,

00:16:40.207 --> 00:16:43.127
this who we are at this moment, you know,

00:16:43.127 --> 00:16:44.378
we worked very hard,

00:16:44.378 --> 00:16:48.048
we've dreamt and prayed so hard and

00:16:48.048 --> 00:16:51.969
it's just, I'm very grateful,

00:16:51.969 --> 00:16:56.515
grateful that God has let us
see and meet each other and

00:16:56.515 --> 00:16:57.349
experience love on this level.

00:16:57.349 --> 00:16:59.560
(both laugh)

00:17:08.318 --> 00:17:09.153
I love you, baby.

00:17:09.153 --> 00:17:09.987
Did I get any makeup on you?

00:17:09.987 --> 00:17:10.821
- I don't know. Did you?

00:17:10.821 --> 00:17:11.655
- I didn't.

00:17:11.655 --> 00:17:13.115
- That's fine.
- That's fine.

00:17:13.115 --> 00:17:16.994
- Story of my life.
(both laugh)

00:17:16.994 --> 00:17:18.203
- Hug me tight.

